  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>z</mi></math> are non-zero distinct real numbers,&nbsp;then<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>z</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is equal to :"
